sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as project_health.cli
    participant Scanner as ProjectScanner
    participant Readme as ReadmeScanner
    participant License as LicenseScanner
    participant Git as GitScanner
    participant Dependency as DependencyScanner
    participant Env as EnvScanner
    participant Analyzer as ReadinessAnalyzer
    participant Renderer as TerminalReport / JsonReport

    User->>CLI: pha scan <path> --output-format terminal|json
    CLI->>CLI: validate path and output format
    CLI->>Scanner: ProjectScanner(path).scan()
    Scanner->>Readme: scan()
    Readme-->>Scanner: CheckResult(readme)
    Scanner->>License: scan()
    License-->>Scanner: CheckResult(license)
    Scanner->>Git: scan()
    Git-->>Scanner: CheckResult(git)
    Scanner->>Dependency: scan()
    Dependency-->>Scanner: CheckResult(Dependencies) + requirements metadata
    Scanner->>Env: EnvScanner(path, requirements).scan()
    Env-->>Scanner: CheckResult(Environment) + available tools
    Scanner-->>CLI: ScanFacts
    CLI->>Analyzer: analyze(ScanFacts)
    Analyzer-->>CLI: ProjectReport(score, status, recommendations)
    CLI->>Renderer: render(ProjectReport)
    Renderer-->>User: terminal table or JSON payload
